&lt;p&gt;Current URL:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20131015124039/http:/www.processtypefoundry.com/typefaces/bryantcon/index.html" title="http://www.processtypefoundry.com/typefaces/bryantcon/index.html"&gt;http://www.processtypefoundry.com/typefaces/bryantcon/index.html&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bryant &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20131015124039/http:/typophile.com/wiki/Condensed"&gt;Condensed&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Designed by &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20131015124039/http:/typophile.com/wiki/Eric%20Olson"&gt;Eric Olson&lt;/a&gt; 2002–2005&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bryant &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20131015124039/http:/typophile.com/wiki/Condensed"&gt;Condensed&lt;/a&gt; is the mid-width family of the &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20131015124039/http:/typophile.com/wiki/Bryant"&gt;Bryant&lt;/a&gt; series.Though &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20131015124039/http:/typophile.com/wiki/condensed"&gt;condensed&lt;/a&gt; in name, this family shares a page color and body width similar to many standard &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20131015124039/http:/typophile.com/wiki/grotesque"&gt;grotesque&lt;/a&gt;s. In other words, it&amp;rsquo;s equally suited for &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20131015124039/http:/typophile.com/wiki/text"&gt;text&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20131015124039/http:/typophile.com/wiki/display"&gt;display&lt;/a&gt; work.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>